{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "b0acb06d6109fb075c2e9961f459d5c24b002215005de8cc6f86a7833c7d14ac", "ja": "トークショーも開催中", "zh": "脱口秀也在举办中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ba90c4c3b5c90de6b0ae576195a7a28ab976c8e3d342537e30fb58cec8a867e4", "ja": "『STARDOM ROAD』メンバーによる\nトークショーも好評を博している。\n出番を控えるこのみ、育、亜利沙はそれぞれ\nの役作りを振り返り、奈緒のまとめもあって\n本番に向けて一層気持ちが盛り上がる。", "zh": "由“STARDOM ROAD”的成员们带来的\n脱口秀也大受好评。\n即将登场的高美、育、亚利沙回顾了各自\n对角色的塑造，再加上奈绪的总结，\n让大家对正式演出的情绪更加高涨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5d44b083b0190df3b0a1d70efda3d01a7b7f9e33faa7adaa91f68e4002389d00", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』で同じ役を演じた\nメンバーたちによる、トークショーが開催中だ）", "zh": "（由《STARDOM ROAD》中饰演相同角色的成员们举办的谈话秀正在进行中）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "84950a91f8aa823b27f6294cf171181cb20b522378bd2f19f3726a7d42971f3d", "ja": "（今はクロエ回が始まっていて、好評みたいだな。\n待機しているメンバーの様子も見ておこう）", "zh": "（现在开始的是克洛伊篇，反响好像很不错。也去看看正在等候的成员们吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0f4e7d6b09f695f09f5eb2f47af6181316e743636f3cd3e75dd36cbd4ebbce87", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。\n話す内容は、もうバッチリって感じか？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n要说的内容，都已经准备得很充分了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "c919ef5f06d59cf392ed65f2aa1dc361f948f5a170f7bf1633d9276dc06067d6", "ja": "任しといてください！　笹森藍は、最初にまつりと\n朋花がばしっと方向性決めてくれましたから。", "zh": "包在我身上！笹森藍这个角色的方向，一开始就是茉莉和朋花果断定下来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "0f73af01a1a0f0d32c7dc76ce0a1f03941890bc2a893e63706fdb39d818c4a9a", "ja": "紗代子、エレナ辺りから遊び心も入って、楽しく\n演じられたなぁって。その辺の話をするつもりです。", "zh": "纱代子、艾蕾娜她们也加入了些玩心，感觉演得很开心。打算聊聊这方面的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "d97a4bcedcce1340d3b859682f7cad7dd237280a7a2fd3ae34e5dc65f2a1a758", "ja": "神宮寺組は積極的にやり取りしてたわね。\n役の相談に乗ったり、そのまま飲んだり……。", "zh": "神宫寺那组可是积极地互相交流呢。\n互相商量角色的事，然后就那么喝起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "33dec1f3a42530d0f7cf797675b100b22a322eb2bc8649c56ca17169ea4d39cc", "ja": "最後は決まって莉緒ちゃんの介抱……自分の出番が\n終わっても全然終わった気がしなかったかも。", "zh": "最后总是要照顾莉緒……自己的戏份结束了，却完全没有结束的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3e60b7bb6589fea8f85ab24cddbb4b4c727b0a9728c785fe08a7103951520242", "ja": "そうでしたか……あれ？\nでも、莉緒はクロエ役だったはずじゃ……。", "zh": "原来是这样……咦？\n可是，莉绪不是演克洛伊的吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "6eae6dd6958bd8ab2f021793b7917d62f322b3fc7775c26de808c1ad3241c5e2", "ja": "だって莉緒ちゃんがいると盛り上がるんだもの！\nだから、ついつい呼んじゃったのよね♪", "zh": "因为有莉绪在，气氛就会热闹起来嘛！\n所以一不小心就把她叫来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "f61b4d4ba5ae71ab95f592bb53ce04e79c315b4c50c16a1511e5c10211e8fb75", "ja": "わたしは真珠星役だったから、環ちゃんと一緒に\n桃子ちゃんに意見を聞きにいったりしたよ。", "zh": "因为我演的是真珠星，所以还和环一起\n去问过桃子的意见呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "e4ed3d9c2ed14d95d7b46084931cb796fc7dc8d40a1c659bb00d72078e5e83b6", "ja": "「桃子に合わせなくて、育の真珠星でいいんだよ」\nって言ってくれて、とっても参考になったんだ。", "zh": "“没必要配合桃子，按照育的真珠星来就好了。”\n她这么对我说，对我来说特别有参考价值。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "d19d877d0ebf4f1f7f90a89ac43a2753c0ce9dc27ae72af85debb6d69c1e07ad", "ja": "あら、素敵なエピソードじゃない！　そうやって\n一緒に役作りができたのも、いい経験になったわよね。", "zh": "哎呀，这故事真棒！像这样\n一起塑造角色的过程，也是很好的经验呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "c3078bd67952cc61f9d8b63f9bd3443f465c9a670c1754b31f52b654797bc2a5", "ja": "うう、いいんでしょうか……？\nほんとに、なる役としてありさが出て……。", "zh": "呜呜，真的可以吗……？\n让亚利沙来演鸣这个角色，真的好吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "33607293523a441e1895ddf198d9c616cf0fc4fa2d44e2643d13484c074455a6", "ja": "もちろん。亜利沙は三船なるを立派に演じてくれた\nわけだし、亜利沙自身、気合い入ってたよな？", "zh": "当然可以。亚利沙出色地演好了三船鸣\n这个角色，而且亚利沙你自己也干劲十足对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "7acf5f892dba6da9b743400a8360a128ce382caa63e1a8fc5250ba32b6945b2b", "ja": "それはそうなんですケド……\nファンのみなさんに特別話せるようなことは……。", "zh": "话是这么说没错啦……\n可是，也没有什么特别值得和各位粉丝说的事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "8ce864ffc867997f30db6a2e359191ab0c70b96943715d29cdfbc4290b44a1ac", "ja": "ははーん？　さては亜利沙、美也に遠慮しとるな？", "zh": "哈哈——？我说，你该不会是在顾虑亚利沙和美也吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "049bfb0e6898e021d281f00aaa3356378610744929e10cd6927fe62e736ef488", "ja": "！？　ど、どうしてわかるんですかぁ！", "zh": "！？为、为什么您会知道啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "266680218b7143fcaec2063d819e395235df2695b32dd6e74eb6a7b8d446adf6", "ja": "そっか。\n美也ちゃんの三船なる、評判だったものね～。", "zh": "这样啊。美也演的三船なる，口碑很不错嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "7de0cc7d03507a977b251d749f1bbabaa8f9de7cbbcc7a86b64926918dc4f5b8", "ja": "そ……そうなんです。三船なるといえば、\nありさの中で、真っ先に美也ちゃんが浮かんで……。", "zh": "是……是这样的。说到三船岬，亚利沙第一个想到的就是美也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "4db6a20b753a84cd82533aaf4474001b8ff911d7f4448a5d9c252137ddfd048b", "ja": "でも、その美也が言うてたで？\n「みんなが積み重ねてくれたおかげです～」って。", "zh": "不过，美也她自己也说过啊？  \n“都是多亏了大家一点一点积累起来的～”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "e391c2af994fb1fd9175da3f887630fb9106778bffe5cf2486505910a1997373", "ja": "特に三幕の「手加減しないで」っていう台詞、\nあの演技で方向性がわかった、って言うとったわ。", "zh": "尤其是第三幕那句“别手下留情”，她说看了那段演技，就明白了该往哪个方向演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "69761e1671cd5d45ac8dbeff8a170941145f90a53f827b6f45428e3704fb29dc", "ja": "三幕のなる、つまり亜利沙の台詞だな。", "zh": "是第三幕里那句台词，也就是亚利沙说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "c5ed922edebf1c78f8f6c20c410231e2dd74bd1fbb35341954acf0e3c6b42dfb", "ja": "その台詞は……、美也ちゃんにも聞かれました。\nどんな感情を込めたかって、何度も。", "zh": "那句台词……美也也问过我。\n问了好多次，我在里面融入了什么样的感情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "279bf33574972183d81b7838a84419305d965aadac9cdc3c79bca8e0eb60af0c", "ja": "あの時は二人の友情を信じていて、\nまさかああいう展開になるとは思わず……。", "zh": "那时亚利沙坚信着两人的友情，\n完全没想到会变成那样的发展……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "6ba48f23eff66434c282d26a6403d0ad4beaf2bf204079069e3eebc44cbd43bb", "ja": "ありさも驚いたというか、何か運命的な力で、\n美也ちゃんに全てが集まっていくような感覚で……！", "zh": "亚利沙也吓了一跳，感觉就像是有某种命运般的力量，\n让一切都向美也汇聚过去一样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "b0513764ad78b7052be90160a887ddc449fc83ea0814207a2d1fdf70cc670a6b", "ja": "なんや、話すこと十分あるやん。\nそれをそのまま喋ったらええんとちゃう？", "zh": "怎么，明明有很多话可说嘛。\n直接把那些说出来不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "83b3cf60d82df555acf9933948ea355fe33d600e6f1660fc3e76f9fa26814a49", "ja": "そうみたいだな。\n奈緒、まとめてくれてありがとう。", "zh": "看来确实是这样。\n奈绪，谢谢你帮我整理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "126a1977e5644b1e6c0c174008507ecc6febed4d16f14cb2a2825ec3636d53a0", "ja": "いえいえ、ただ通りすがりついでにツッコミ入れた\nだけですから。ほな、シフトに行ってきます～。", "zh": "哪里哪里，我只是路过的时候顺便吐槽了一句而已。那我去值班啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "081eeec66c2e14c6bb8b904a7bdabb048cc0d8d0678f9399df118642b464e018", "ja": "ふふっ。みんなで演じたことが繋がってこその\n『STARDOM ROAD』公演……。", "zh": "呵呵。正因为大家共同演绎的一切彼此相连，才有了\n《STARDOM ROAD》公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "57a99681217d67c4d95ea42622ae857e6a17a26da2f81119e9b31f6461ba73b1", "ja": "誰か一人でも欠けたら、きっと全然違っていたと思う。\n当たり前のことなんだけど……。", "zh": "要是少了其中任何一个人，肯定都会大不一样吧。\n虽然这是理所当然的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "bc9fe18ce2341683661963b586a465d3af59f6bb1c5e47a7a5f2c2fac1478a66", "ja": "でも、とっても素敵なことよね！\nお姉さん、改めてそう感じちゃった♪", "zh": "但是，这真的是一件非常美好的事呢！\n姐姐再次感受到了这一点♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "25d679d4db2d5c9fe1b1caa12775bc3ed76fa7b42abf2209ed3bcea510fc30a8", "ja": "このみさん……。\nはい。それは、ありさもそう思います……！", "zh": "木乃美姐……  \n嗯，亚利沙也这么觉得……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "ee71bd0c5c2c000202911447b29b0d08122a813ef3cba3d353143d54f322ee8f", "ja": "なら、お客さんにいっぱい聞いてもらいましょう。\n私たちの悩みも、苦労も。とっておきの思い出も！", "zh": "那就让客人们多听听吧。\n无论是我们的烦恼、辛苦，还是珍藏的回忆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1033_030iku", "source_sha256": "689a30b341f40568b067091fe8d60ef2116d6a6552f7e99deff354e3ebf5577a", "ja": "わたしも！　みんなの真珠星から感じたこと、\nぜーんぶお話しするね！", "zh": "我也要！我会把从大家的真珠星里感受到的一切，\n全～部都讲出来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "4366b7a7823ae886318aba0523cf75969d59d5e22f5b25a4979ab2867c288ced", "ja": "わかりました。こうなったら、ありさも三船なる最推し\nオタクの一人として、余すところなく語ってみせます！", "zh": "我明白了。既然如此，亚利沙也要作为把三船鸣当成唯一至爱的阿宅之一，毫无保留地畅聊一番！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_03_1035_p", "source_sha256": "db9efa91ca9a9a448ae0ad82f0920ab09b609d4696cd2b6d45ab52bd7e256dad", "ja": "（……どうやら、思った以上に内容の濃い、\nいいトークショーになりそうだ。楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（……看来会是一场内容比想象中还丰富的精彩访谈秀。真让人期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
